**Primary Files**:
- `/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/show-controller/src/pages/ControllerPage.jsx` - Main UI for editing config
- `/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/show-controller/src/pages/DashboardPage.jsx` - Competition creation/editing (sets defaults)
- `/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/show-controller/src/pages/HomePage.jsx` - Same modal as DashboardPage
- `/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/show-controller/src/hooks/useCompetitions.js` - Firebase update logic

**Supporting Files**:
- `/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/show-controller/src/context/ShowContext.jsx` - Lines 361-363 (config field references)
